title: Scroll Read
tempo: 120
# desc: Unrolling a scroll: a papery swish followed by a single dark chime.
# use: Reading a scroll, letter or lore item.
# tags: rpg-ui, scroll, read, neutral, lore, letter
# palette: neutral
# zone: any
# fit: core

instrument v1: noise volume=0.2 attack=0.02 release=0.05 slide=6 slide_time=0.1
instrument v2: fm volume=0.25 ratio=2.76 index=3 index_decay=0.5 attack=0.001 decay=0.6 sustain=0 release=0.05 detune=18 echo=0.3

v1: A5:0.4 R:1.76
v2: R:0.36 Ab5:0.8 R:1
